        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wuwana ghwa Jonathani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituku jimu, Jonathani mwana wa Sauli ukamzera uo mdawana orekoghe ukimdukia maswagha, “Nndoko diruwuke ija chia cha ngomenyi ya Wafilisti.” Ela Jonathani orekoghe usemghorie ndee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli orekoghe ukikaia aisi ya mkomamanga aja Migroni kutua kwa Gibea; nao orekwanyeghe na wandu maghana arandadu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aghadi yawo, orekoghe mwana wa Ahitubu mruna Ikabodi mwana wa Finehasi, wawae Eli uo orekoghe mkohani wa BWANA aja Shilo; nao orekoghe ukirwa naivera. Wandu ndeweremanyireghe wei Jonathani waghenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ugho mwanya ghwa Mikmashi, andu Jonathani oreidiriagha kuvikia ngome ya Wafilisti, korekoghe na mchombololo ghwa magho ii chia na mchombololo ghumu ghwa magho ii chia. Mchombololo ghumu ghorewangwaghwa Bosesi, na ghumu Sene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mchombololo ghumu ghorewukieghe chia ya kaskazinyi naimbiri ya Mikmashi, na ghumu chia ya kusinyi naimbiri ya Geba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Jonathani ukamzera uja mdawana oremdukiagha maswagha, “Nndoko diruwuke ija chia cha ngomenyi ya awa wandu wiseshamishiro, kewada BWANA wadima kuditesia; kwa kukaia ndekuwadie ilagho jingi jidimagha kumghiria BWANA usekire kwa kutumia wandu wengi angu watini.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uja mdawana oremdukiagha maswagha ukatumbulia, “Bonya ijo jose kwajiririkanya kukaia icha; dekwanye chiaimweri, sa iji koni kwaririkanya nikokoni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonathani ukaghamba, “Oke ndediruwuke dikuwonyere kwa awo wandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikadizera, ‘Weserenyi diche konyu,’ dichakaia aeni diko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela wikadizera, ‘Choonyi,’ dichaghenda; kwa kukaia BWANA wameria kuwingira mikonunyi kodu. Iyo ichakaia niyo alama yedu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko wose wawi wikakuwonyera weni aja ngomenyi kwa Wafilisti, na Wafilisti wikaghamba, “Wonenyi Waebrania waawuyafuma mirumenyi, andu wikuvisireghe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao waja wandu wa ngomenyi wikawiwinga Jonathani na mduki maswagha wake wikaghamba, “Ola choonyi dimmbonyere ilagho jimu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Jonathani ukamzera uja mduki maswagha wake, “Ninughe, kwa kukaia BWANA wameria kuwingira mikonunyi kwa Israeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonathani ukazoya kujoka na mikonu na maghu na uja mduki maswagha ukakaia ukimnugha. Jonathani ukakaia ukiwighusha wamaiza, na uo mundu oremdukieghe maswagha ukakaia ukiwibwagha ngelo orenughagha nanyuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na uko kubwagha kwa imbiri korebonyeroghe ni Jonathani na uo mduki maswagha korekoghe kwa wandu mirongo iwi, andenyi ya andu korekoghe na kipimo sa cha nusu eka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wafilisti werekoghe kambinyi, na awo werekoghe cha shighadinyi na ngomenyi, wikangilwa ni kiture kibaa; hata na awo widwagha wandu wunyika wikaobua, na ndoe ikasughusika; na wandu wose wikangilwa ni wowa m'baa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kusimwa kwa Wafilisti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walindiri wa Sauli awo werekoghe Gibea isanga ja Benjamini, wikawusira meso wikazighana; nao wikawona Wafilisti wasaghisika ii chia na ii chia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Sauli ukawizera wandu wake orekwanyeghe nawo, “Talenyi wandu dipate kummanya umundu usekwanye nesi.” Wikatala wandu wikakua Jonathani na uja mundu oremdukiagha maswagha wiseko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli ukamzera Ahija, “Reda Sanduku ya Mlungu aha.” Kwa kukaia iyo ngelo Sanduku ya Mlungu erekoghe ikikaia kwa wandu wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji Sauli orekoghe ukidedanya na mkohani, ndoghoi ikachurikia andenyi ya kambi ya Wafilisti; na Sauli ukamzera mkohani, “Sigha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Sauli na wandu wose orekwanyeghe nawo, wikafuma na kungia wudenyi gholwa na Wafilisti; wikawona kukaia Wafilisti wedeeka wikibwaghana weni na weni wisemanyagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata na Waebrania wamu werekoghe wikikaia kwa Wafilisti kiimbiri, na kujokanya cha kambinyi kwawo wikaghaluka na kukukwanya na awo Waisraeli werekanyeghe andwamweri na Sauli na Jonathani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wokoni wandu wose wa Israeli werekuvisireghe mighondinyi ya Efraimu wiendasikira kukaia Wafilisti waawuyakimbia, wikafuma na kungia wudenyi ghowiwinga Wafilisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko huwo ituku ijo BWANA ukawikira Israeli. Wuda ghukaenda imbiri hata kuida kimonu cha Beth-aveni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Maza ribonyekie nyuma ya ugho wuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waisraeli wikasirimika kwa wundu ghwa njala ituku jija, kwa kukaia Sauli orewighemeshereghe wandu ukighamba, “Mndungi ukaja vindo nisemerie kulipa kisasi aighu ya wamaiza wapo hata luma lwa kenyi, uwado ni njowe.” Kwa huwo mndungi ndechetoa vindo ijo ituku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wose wikacha na kuvika kilembenyi, na aho wikawona wuki andonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wose wiendangia andenyi kilembenyi wuki ghukakaia ghukitonya andonyi, ela ndekorekoghe na mndungi oredimieghe kughushoa na kughutoa; angu wandu wose wereobueghe ijo ighemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Jonathani nderekoghe wasikira iji ndee oreghemeshagha wandu. Kwa huwo ukaghorua mzata ghorekoghe mkonunyi kwake, ukaghungira andenyi ya indo ja wuki na kuleta, na meso ghake ghikaela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao mndumu ukamzera, “Nechi ndeyo waghemesha wandu wei Mndungi ukaja vindo idime, uwado ni njowe; na huwu wandu wasilwa nandighi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Jonathani ukatumbulia, “Aba waawuyasumbua wandu; wona seji ini meso ghapo ghaela niendatoa wuki mtinieri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwamanya yakaiagha nicha saki ngera wandu wedesighwa wikaie huru kuja vindo va wamaiza wawo wawidwa wunyika idime; kumangu wabwagha Wafilisti wengi kuchumba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituku jija wikawikaba Wafilisti kufuma Mikmashi hata Aijaloni. Na wandu werekoghe wasilwa nandighi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nawo wikaramia vilambo wavidwa wunyika, wikawada ng'ondi, na ng'ombe, na ngache; wikaribwagha ahoeni, wikaja nyama chiaimweri na bagha yaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao wikamghoria Sauli wikighamba, “Zighana wandu wakam'bonyera BWANA kaung'a kwa kuja nyama chiaimweri na bagha yaro.” Sauli ukaghamba, “Mwabonya kiwiwi, ning'arishirenyi igho ibaa idime.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
