        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli ukachuria kughora, “Fumenyi muwizere wandu, ‘Kula mundu nderede ng'ombe yake angu ng'ondi yake, uche uibwaghe aha, uje; ela msakem'bonyera BWANA kaung'a kwa kuijanya na bagha yaro.’” Niko kula mundu ukareda ng'ombe yake chija kio na kuibwaghia aho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli ukamuaghia BWANA madhabahu, nayo erekoghe madhabahu yake ya imbiri oremuaghieghe BWANA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Sauli ukawizera wandu wake, “Nndokonyi diwinughe Wafilisti nakio, diwikabe na kuwisoka vilambo hata ndoe kuelenyi; diwibwaghe na kuwimeria.” Nawo wikaghamba, “Bonya ijo jose kujiwonagha kukaia icha kwako.” Ela mkohani ukaghamba, “Dimkotie Mlungu kande.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Sauli ukamkotia Mlungu ukighamba, “Welee, niwiserie Wafilisti? Kuchawifunya wikabo ni Waisraeli?” Ela ijo ituku Mlungu nderemtumbulieghe anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Sauli ukaghamba, “Choonyi aha inyo vilongozi vose va wandu dipate kumanya ngera ni kaung'aki yabonywa kodu idime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu naghema kwa BWANA uko moyo, uo uwikiragha Israeli, hata eewoneka kwa mwana wapo Jonathani, kwa loli uchabwaghwa.” Ela ndekorekoghe na mndungi aghadi ya awo wandu oremtumbulieghe ilagho jingi anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli ukawizera Waisraeli wose, “Kaienyi luwaru lonyu, na ini na mwana wapo Jonathani dikaie luwaru lodu.” Na wandu wikamtumbulia, “Bonya ijo kujiwonagha kukaia icha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Sauli ukalomba, “Ee BWANA Mlungu wa Israeli, kwaki idime kusenitumbulie ini mdumiki wako? Ikakaia wuwiwi ghooka kwapo angu kwa mwana wapo Jonathani, ee BWANA Mlungu wa Israeli kufunye Urimu; ela ikakaia ghooka kwa wandu wako Israeli, kufunye Thumimu.” Nao matumbulio ghikawonyera kukaia ni kwa Jonathani na Sauli, hata si kwa wandu anduangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mit. 27.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.28.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam. 28.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli ukaghamba, “Idana tanya aghadi yapo na mwana wapo Jonathani.” Nao Jonathani ukawadwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Sauli ukamzera Jonathani, “Nighorie seji kwabonya.” Jonathani ukamghoria, “Naaleta wuki mtinieri kwa kutumia mdo ghwa mzata nighuwadieghe; na idana neko tayari kufwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli ukaghamba, “Kwa loli kawona kusefwagha idime Jonathani, Mlungu unibwaghe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko wandu wikamzera Sauli, “Ado Jonathani uabwaghwa umoni wawiredia Israeli wusimi m'baa? Agho ghikaie kula putu! Sa iji BWANA ukaiagha moyo, ndekuwadie hata luwiriro lwa iridia jake luchaakulwa na kupotolwa andonyi, kwa kukaia Jonathani waateselwa ni Mlungu idime.” Nao wandu wikamvuvua Jonathani usebwagho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Sauli ukasigha kuwiwinga Wafilisti, na Wafilisti wikawuya cha mzawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kubonya nguma kwa Sauli na kinyumba chake",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli uendawada wuzuri aighu ya Israeli, ukalwa na wamaiza wake kula andu; ukalwa na Wamoabu, na Waamoni, na Waedomu, na wazuri wa Soba, na Wafilisti; andu kose orelueghe nawo ukakaia ukiwisima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukalwa kwa wuing'oni na kuwikaba Waamaleki, hata ukawikira Waisraeli kufuma kwa makorongo gha awo wandu wose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Sauli ni awa: Jonathani, na Ishvi, na Malkishua; marina gha wai wake wawi ni: Merabu mwai wake wa imbiri, na uo mtini orewangwaghwa Mikali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkake Sauli orewangwaghwa Ahinoamu, mwai wa Ahimaazi. M'baa wa majeshi ghake orewangwaghwa Abneri mwana wa Neri, na uo Neri ni mruna ndee Sauli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli ndee, uo Kishi, na Abneri ndee, uo Neri, ni wana wa Abieli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.51"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
